\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Every trained comparison, on the primary architecture and endpoint.} A gap must exceed its own campaign's bar \emph  {and} agree in sign across seeds to count. Four campaigns attack the decisive gap from different directions and none of them moves it; the positive control, which compares against a method we expected to be clearly worse, clears its bar more than threefold. Per-cell tables for both architectures and both endpoints are in Appendix~\ref {app:diag}. \emph  {Sources:} \texttt  {abc\_verdict.json} and its \texttt  {or/}, \texttt  {fx/}, \texttt  {se/} variants; \texttt  {pc\_verdict.json}.}}{5}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
